## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates understanding of on-device NLP under strict resource constraints, multilingual support, and practical privacy considerations—while remaining accessible to beginners.

## Key Concepts
- On-device machine learning inference
- Lightweight multilingual NLP
- Hashed bag-of-words features with linear models
